<block xmlns="http://blockml.org/schema/block" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://blockml.org/schema/block https://blockml.org/schemas/core/block.xsd"
  xmlns:btype="org.blockml.bml.type"
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core">
  <name>Float</name>
  <type>btype:Float</type>
  <baseType>btype:Number</baseType>
  <is>Binary floating-point numeric type — special-purpose only.</is>

  <documentation>BOM Core primitive ValueType for binary floating-point numbers. Not the default
    floating-point type — use Decimal unless binary IEEE754 semantics are explicitly required
    (GPU, OpenGL, native C APIs, binary protocols). Unqualified name Float resolves to
    org.blockml.bml.type.Float. Extends org.blockml.bml.type.Number. Values are stored in Properties.</documentation>
</block>